{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep1/quest_story/11107030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110703001:1":{"text":"ブルータス様、今この場で試合を行ったとして、あなたがオレとアルサに負ける可能性なんてあると思いますか？","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人。您认为此时此刻，在一场公平的决斗中，您会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76180E9FA6F6B4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110703002:1":{"text":"いいや、ないな。ソーン、アルサ、お前たちは間違いなく同年齢のババリアの中で一番強い。","source_cn":"我从未那么想过。索恩，阿尔萨，你们是你们这个年纪的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F7C6F2FCBB041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110703003:1":{"text":"だが、戦いの勘を研ぎ澄ますには豊富な経験が必要だ。それは一朝一夕で達成できるものではない。","source_cn":"但若想锤炼最完美的战斗直觉，经验必不可少，这绝非一朝一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3632331FAB21D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110703004:1":{"text":"オレもそう思います。ですから、戦歌祭の勝者という称号は、今のオレたちにはまだ荷が重すぎます。","source_cn":"我们也是这么想的。战歌节胜者这一称号，对现在的我们来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A95145AEF346EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110703005:1":{"text":"そうだね、自分の勝利した姿を想像したことはあるけど……僕も、ソーンも、そしてみんなも――","source_cn":"没错，虽然我们是有偷偷幻想过啦……但在我心中、在索恩心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE809B19EA516BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110703006:1":{"text":"ブルータス様こそが勝者であり、砂漠最強の戦神だと思ってますから！","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人，您才是当之无愧的胜者，是这片沙漠最强的战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A61FED3F36D8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110703007:1":{"text":"……次の、さらに次の戦歌祭ぐらいまでは。","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110703007":{"text":"……次の、さらに次の戦歌祭ぐらいまでは。","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110703008:1":{"text":"……やっぱり、ブルータス様にはオレの考えを知ってほしいと思って。","source_cn":"我想了想，还是希望布鲁特斯大人知道我的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC809434C5EB5BFCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110703009:1":{"text":"ははははっ！いいだろう！ソーン、アルサ……","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！好！索恩，阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CA28AF9D6DF794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110703010:1":{"text":"戦神の名は我が預かろう！お前たちが我に挑むその日までな！","source_cn":"我会替你们保留着战神之名，直到你们强到足够挑战我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345A5A94C8DE1BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110703011:1":{"text":"ええ、そう遠くない日に。","source_cn":"会有那一天的。或许比您想得快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5EA7601815047B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110703012:1":{"text":"それと、戦歌祭に参加した目的を僕たちに聞きましたよね？その目的はすでに果たしましたよ！","source_cn":"而且，您曾经问我和索恩参加战歌节的目的对吧？现在，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F3A379FD8D57D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110703013:1":{"text":"ええ！今やウール族の名前は砂漠中にとどろき渡っているわ！","source_cn":"没错！现在，乌尔氏族的名声已经传遍了沙漠的每个角落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70DBEABDC56E0212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110703014:1":{"text":"戦歌祭の観客も、そうじゃない人たちも、みんなが白と黒の若き勇士を知ってるもの。","source_cn":"无论是不是曼卡拉的老朋友，甚至最不关心战歌节的人，也都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E9A9697F2CB468","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110703015:1":{"text":"昨日までは無名の二人が、今や英雄よ！こんなの、神様でも絶賛するサクセスストーリーだわ。","source_cn":"昨日还是无名之辈，现在却成了英雄！恐怕连神都爱看这样的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1217D1D40BA21272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110703016:1":{"text":"よかろう。では……達者でな、ソーン、アルサ。我はやることがあるゆえ、先に失礼する。","source_cn":"如此便好。那么……保重，索恩，阿尔萨。我有些事要处理，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0545C68FD823439A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110703017:1":{"text":"ブルータス様もお元気で！いつかウールにも遊びに来て下さいね！","source_cn":"保重，布鲁特斯大人！有机会请一定来我们氏族坐坐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF2FAF577219F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110703018:1":{"text":"アルサ……おい、ぼーっとしてどうした？","source_cn":"阿尔萨……喂，好端端地发什么愣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE4617BA9A2333C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110703019:1":{"text":"え？えっとね……少し恥ずかしいけど、ブルータス様を見てたら、父ちゃんを思い出しちゃって……","source_cn":"啊？哦……说来有点害臊，刚才布鲁特斯大人的样子，让我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE2CA879BF74C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110703020:1":{"text":"父君はどのような方だったのだ？","source_cn":"那是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A313E6AC53D465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110703021:1":{"text":"あ、ち、違うんです！父ちゃんはごくごく普通のババリアで、あなたと戦ったら秒で負けちゃうような人です！たぶん今の僕でも勝てるかと……","source_cn":"您别误会！我们的老爹是个普通得不能再普通的蛮血。在您手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x522BA4E4AC4B598A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110703022:1":{"text":"でも、父ちゃんは……世界一優しい人なんです。ただ、それだけです。ソーン、早く帰ろう！僕、父ちゃんに報告したくてうずうずしてるんだ！","source_cn":"他只是……世界上最好的人，仅此而已。索恩，我们快点回去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072815F6ACBA1920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110703023:1":{"text":"ああ……オレもだ。","source_cn":"嗯……我也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A9FBF559F437A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"……正直だな。","source_cn":"……还是说实话了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26BC4AD992DD605D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"……正直だな。","female":"……正直ね。","variant_male_record_index":"63654","variant_female_record_index":"63655","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"一言多いんじゃ……？","source_cn